        "content_body": "On Kohls, UI layout pitfalls include dynamically changing element IDs and unexpected filter states, which make it difficult to reliably locate the correct product filters. Interaction traps involve incorrect selection of filter options (e.g., size or color) due to mismatched element IDs, and the correct interaction requires manually verifying filter options after each step rather than relying on static element IDs."
      }
