      "payload": {
        "scenario_description": "ticketcenter",
        "memory_description": "Ticketing website 'ticketcenter' has inconsistent UI layout and unclear interaction pathways for filtering events.",
        "content_body": "On the ticketcenter website, UI layout pitfalls include unexpected placement of event filters and inconsistent element IDs, which led to incorrect element selection during the task. For example, the 'Wicked' show search was not properly linked to the venue browsing section, causing a mismatch in clickable elements. Website interaction traps include the absence of clear date range input fields and the need to navigate through multiple hidden or dynamically loaded elements to access venue listings, which were not accessible via standard click actions. Correct interaction would involve locating the event search bar, entering 'Wicked', and then navigating through the dynamically loaded results to select the correct date range and venue filter options."
      }
    },
