      "payload": {
        "scenario_description": "sixflags",
        "memory_description": "Sixflags website has dynamic UI elements and inconsistent form field placement, leading to interaction and layout pitfalls.",
        "content_body": "On the Sixflags website, UI layout pitfalls include unexpected element positions and dynamic content shifts, such as the meal plan selection and payment plan options not being where expected, which caused incorrect element selection. Website interaction traps involve incorrect form field targeting, such as entering age in a zip code field and zip code in an age field, as well as misaligned click targets for payment plan selection. Users must carefully verify form labels and ensure they are interacting with the correct elements, especially when fields are dynamically generated or mislabeled."
      }
