      "payload": {
        "scenario_description": "viator",
        "memory_description": "Viator website has inconsistent UI layout and unclear interaction pathways that hinder task completion.",
        "content_body": "On the Viator website, UI layout pitfalls include unexpected placement of search and navigation elements, making it difficult to locate the correct input fields for searching activities in Amsterdam. Additionally, website interaction traps involve misleading or non-functional buttons, such as the absence of a 'Wish List' option on certain activity pages, which prevents users from completing the task of adding an activity to their wish list. Users must ensure they are on the correct activity detail page and look for a 'Save to Wishlist' button, which may not be immediately visible or may be nested under additional menu options."
      }
    },
