        "content_body": "On IMDb, the UI layout can be misleading as search results and navigation elements may not be positioned as expected, leading to incorrect element selection. Additionally, interaction traps occur when critical elements like 'Cast' links are not visible or accessible in the cleaned HTML, requiring users to navigate through unexpected pathways or use alternative methods such as scrolling or expanding sections to locate them."
