        "scenario_description": "newegg",
        "memory_description": "Newegg website has dynamic UI elements and inconsistent element IDs, leading to interaction and layout pitfalls.",
        "content_body": "On Newegg, UI layout pitfalls include dynamically changing element IDs and unexpected placement of product filters and sorting options, which can mislead automated selection. Website interaction traps involve incorrect element targeting for actions like selecting the 'Lowest Price' option, as the correct elements are not consistently identifiable or accessible in the HTML structure. Users must ensure they are interacting with the correct, visible, and stable elements, especially when filtering or sorting products, as the site frequently updates or restructures its DOM."
      }
