      "payload": {
        "scenario_description": "underarmour",
        "memory_description": "Under Armour website has dynamic element IDs and inconsistent UI layout that cause interaction failures.",
        "content_body": "On the Under Armour website, UI layout pitfalls include dynamically changing element IDs and unexpected placement of interactive elements, making it difficult to reliably select the correct components. Website interaction traps involve incorrect click targets due to overlapping or shifting elements, such as when attempting to select a specific shoe size (5.5) or adding items to the cart, where the intended action element may be misidentified or not present in the expected location. Users must carefully verify element positions and ensure they are interacting with the correct, visible, and stable UI components, especially during dynamic page loads or when filtering product options."
      }
    },
