        "content_body": "On Gamestop's website, UI layout pitfalls include unexpected placement of input fields and inconsistent element IDs, which led to incorrect element selection during zip code entry. Additionally, website interaction traps involve hidden or dynamically loaded elements (like the store selection button with ID [31807]) that are not accessible through standard interaction flows, requiring users to bypass or discover them manually rather than through direct input or visible navigation options."
