        "scenario_description": "airbnb",
        "memory_description": "Airbnb website: UI layout inconsistencies and hidden interaction steps caused task failure.",
        "content_body": "On Airbnb, the UI layout pitfalls included unexpected placement of interactive elements, such as search filters and date pickers, which were not where anticipated. Additionally, the website interaction traps involved hidden or dynamically loaded buttons (e.g., 'Search' or 'Apply' filters) that were not accessible in the cleaned HTML, requiring users to navigate through additional steps or modal windows. Correct interaction involves ensuring all filters are applied via the visible search bar and confirming date ranges using the calendar picker, which may not be directly accessible via element IDs in automated tasks."
      }
