      "payload": {
        "scenario_description": "redbox",
        "memory_description": "Redbox website has inconsistent UI layout and unclear interaction pathways for on-demand movie rentals.",
        "content_body": "On the Redbox website, UI layout pitfalls include the absence of clear visual indicators for movie titles in the on-demand section, making it difficult to locate 'The Whale' for rental. Additionally, the website's interaction traps involve missing or non-interactive elements for selecting the 'high definition' format, as the expected format selection button was not present or accessible in the cleaned HTML. Users may also encounter unexpected UI states, such as skipped steps where the target element is not found in the page content, leading to task failure."
      }
    },
