        "scenario_description": "resy",
        "memory_description": "Resy website has dynamic UI elements and inconsistent element IDs that cause interaction failures.",
        "content_body": "On the Resy website, UI layout pitfalls include dynamically changing element IDs and unexpected placement of form fields, making it difficult to locate the correct input areas for profile details. Interaction traps involve incorrect element targeting during form submission, such as clicking the wrong button to save changes, which leads to task failure. Additionally, allergy and bio fields may not be clearly labeled or accessible in the expected UI flow, further complicating the task."
