      "payload": {
        "scenario_description": "amtrak",
        "memory_description": "Amtrak website has dynamic content loading and inconsistent element IDs, leading to interaction failures.",
        "content_body": "On the Amtrak website, UI layout pitfalls include dynamically changing element IDs and unexpected content positioning, which can mislead automated interactions. Website interaction traps involve clicking on elements that appear relevant but do not trigger the expected behavior, such as skipping over critical content sections that are not properly rendered in the cleaned HTML. The correct interaction is to ensure that the target element is both visible and correctly identified in the DOM before performing a click, and to account for dynamic content loading delays."
      }
