        "scenario_description": "booking",
        "memory_description": "Booking.com has dynamic UI elements and inconsistent layout structures that lead to interaction failures.",
        "content_body": "On Booking.com, UI layout pitfalls include dynamically changing element IDs and unexpected placement of filters, which caused incorrect element selection during the task. Website interaction traps involve misaligned action targets, such as clicking on the wrong filter options (e.g., selecting a non-free wifi option or incorrect date range), and missing required steps like applying filters for no prepayment and review score of 7+. The correct interaction involves carefully verifying each filter option before clicking and ensuring all criteria are applied sequentially."
      }
