      "payload": {
        "scenario_description": "uniqlo",
        "memory_description": "Uniqlo website has dynamic filtering and inconsistent UI layout that leads to interaction traps.",
        "content_body": "On the Uniqlo website, UI layout pitfalls include dynamically changing element IDs and unexpected filter state resets, which make it difficult to predict where elements will be located. Interaction traps involve incorrect filter application sequences, such as selecting size or color before category, which can lead to incomplete or incorrect product listings. To successfully filter for Men's Blazers, Black, Size M, first navigate to the 'Men's' category, then apply the 'Blazers' subcategory, followed by selecting 'Black' color and 'Size M' in the correct order. Ensure that filters are applied sequentially and confirmed with visible UI feedback before proceeding."
      }
    },
