        "scenario_description": "tesla",
        "memory_description": "Tesla website: UI layout inconsistencies and unclear interaction pathways caused task failure.",
        "content_body": "On the Tesla website, UI layout pitfalls included unexpected element positions and inconsistent state rendering, making it difficult to locate the correct inventory filters. Interaction traps involved incorrect element IDs being targeted during the task, such as clicking on non-functional or irrelevant elements instead of the intended inventory filters for the Model Y with performance all-wheel drive. The correct interaction would involve navigating to the 'Used Inventory' section, applying precise filters for 'Model Y' and 'Performance All-Wheel Drive' using the correct UI elements, and ensuring that the selected elements correspond to the intended functionality."
      }
