      "payload": {
        "scenario_description": "spothero",
        "memory_description": "Spothero is a parking booking website where UI inconsistencies and interaction traps caused task failure.",
        "content_body": "On Spothero, UI layout pitfalls included unexpected placement of search input fields, where the search box was not in the expected location, leading to incorrect element selection. Additionally, interaction traps involved case sensitivity in dropdown selections (e.g., 'price' vs. 'Price'), which caused the selection action to fail. Correct interaction requires precise case matching and careful attention to element positioning, which may differ from standard layouts."
      }
