      "payload": {
        "scenario_description": "discogs",
        "memory_description": "Discogs website has dynamic filtering and non-intuitive navigation that leads to misinterpretation of element interactions.",
        "content_body": "On Discogs, UI layout pitfalls include elements not being in expected locations, such as search filters and sorting options being nested within dropdowns or hidden tabs, which can mislead automated selection. Additionally, interaction traps involve incorrect use of element types, such as attempting to 'SELECT' a button instead of 'CLICK'ing it, or misinterpreting labels like 'want,desc' when the correct interaction requires selecting a 'Most Wanted' filter. Correct actions involve clicking visible filters and ensuring the right element types are used for interaction, such as clicking on 'Most Wanted' rather than trying to select a non-interactive label."
      }
    },
