      "payload": {
        "scenario_description": "qatarairways",
        "memory_description": "Qatar Airways website has inconsistent UI layout and unclear interaction pathways for travel requirement checks.",
        "content_body": "On the Qatar Airways website, UI layout pitfalls include elements not being in expected locations, such as the final step button for checking travel requirements being misplaced or not clearly labeled. Interaction traps involve incorrect element selection during the final step, where the predicted click target [118883] did not match the intended target [113921], leading to task failure. Users must carefully verify the correct button for submission, as similar-looking buttons may exist, and the website does not provide clear visual cues to distinguish between them."
      }
