      "payload": {
        "scenario_description": "rentalcars",
        "memory_description": "Rentalcars.com has inconsistent UI layout and non-intuitive interaction elements that lead to task failure.",
        "content_body": "On rentalcars.com, UI layout pitfalls include unexpected placement of date pickers and search buttons, which can mislead users into selecting incorrect elements. For example, the date selection field was not recognized as a clickable element, and the search button was not properly identified. Website interaction traps involve actions like clicking on non-interactive elements or selecting dropdown options incorrectly. The correct interaction is to click on the date field to open the calendar, select the desired dates, and ensure the 'Search' button is clicked after setting all parameters, rather than interacting with unrelated elements."
      }
    },
