      "payload": {
        "scenario_description": "kayak",
        "memory_description": "Kayak website has dynamic UI elements and inconsistent form field labeling, leading to interaction and layout pitfalls.",
        "content_body": "On the Kayak website, UI layout pitfalls include dynamically changing element IDs and unexpected placement of form fields, making it difficult to reliably locate input areas for travel restrictions. Interaction traps involve the absence of explicit 'Travel Restrictions' or 'Visa Information' buttons or links, requiring users to infer or search for this information elsewhere, which is not intuitive. Additionally, the form fields for origin and destination may not be clearly labeled or may change IDs dynamically, leading to failed interactions when attempting to input 'United States' and 'Cambodia'."
      }
