      "payload": {
        "scenario_description": "apple",
        "memory_description": "Apple website: UI layout inconsistencies and hidden navigation elements caused task failure.",
        "content_body": "On the Apple website, UI layout pitfalls included unexpected placement of navigation elements, making it difficult to locate the correct product page for the latest MacBook Air. Additionally, website interaction traps involved hidden or dynamically loaded elements (not present in the cleaned HTML), which led to failed clicks on critical steps such as accessing technical specifications. Users must ensure they navigate through the 'Mac' section and select the latest MacBook Air model explicitly, as direct links to specs are not always visible or accessible via standard interaction paths."
      }
