      "payload": {
        "scenario_description": "target",
        "memory_description": "E-commerce site 'Target' has inconsistent product filtering and unclear UI states that hinder task completion.",
        "content_body": "On Target's website, UI layout pitfalls include inconsistent product title formatting (e.g., 'queen-sized bed sheets' vs. 'bed sheets queen'), which led to incorrect element selection. Additionally, the star rating system is not clearly visible on product cards, making it difficult to filter for 4-star items. Interaction traps include the absence of a direct 'Add to Cart' button on some product pages, requiring users to navigate through a 'Buy Now' flow instead, which was not anticipated and caused task failure."
      }
    },
