      "payload": {
        "scenario_description": "cabelas",
        "memory_description": "Cabelas website has dynamic content and inconsistent element IDs, leading to interaction failures.",
        "content_body": "On the Cabelas website, UI layout pitfalls include dynamically changing element IDs and unexpected placement of interactive elements, which caused incorrect selections during navigation. Website interaction traps involve failed clicks on clearance sale items due to mismatched element IDs, as well as skipped steps where the ground truth elements were not present in the cleaned HTML. The correct interaction requires verifying element IDs dynamically and ensuring that clearance sale filters (e.g., 9 mm pistols with a 4-5 star rating) are applied before attempting to click on items."
      }
