      "payload": {
        "scenario_description": "flightaware",
        "memory_description": "FlightAware website has dynamic content loading and inconsistent UI element identifiers, leading to interaction failures.",
        "content_body": "On FlightAware, UI layout pitfalls include dynamically changing element IDs and unexpected placement of discussion sections, which can mislead automated navigation. Interaction traps involve incorrect element targeting due to non-static IDs and the need to wait for content to load fully before interacting. To succeed, ensure dynamic content is fully rendered and use stable selectors like text-based or class-based targeting instead of relying on numerical IDs."
      }
