      "payload": {
        "scenario_description": "store.steampowered",
        "memory_description": "Steam store website has dynamic content loading and unclear filtering options for simulation games.",
        "content_body": "UI Layout Pitfalls: The search and filter elements for game genres and price categories are not consistently positioned or labeled, leading to confusion in locating the correct options. Website Interaction Traps: Attempting to search for 'farming & crafting simulation games that are free' via direct text input fails because Steam's search functionality does not support complex genre-based queries. The correct interaction involves using the 'Genre' filter and selecting 'Simulation' followed by applying the 'Free to Play' filter to narrow results."
      }
