      "payload": {
        "scenario_description": "espn",
        "memory_description": "ESPN website has dynamic content and inconsistent element identifiers, leading to interaction and layout pitfalls.",
        "content_body": "On the ESPN website, UI layout pitfalls include dynamically changing element IDs and unexpected placement of dropdowns or filters, which can mislead the selection of specific options like 'Portugal' or 'World Cup.' Interaction traps involve incorrect or ambiguous dropdown selections, such as selecting 'fifa.world' instead of 'World Cup,' which fails to retrieve the intended statistics. Users must carefully verify dropdown options and ensure they select the exact match for the desired filter, as the site does not always provide clear visual cues for these choices."
      }
    },
