      "payload": {
        "scenario_description": "yelp",
        "memory_description": "Yelp website: UI layout inconsistencies and case-sensitive input traps caused task failure.",
        "content_body": "On Yelp, the UI layout pitfalls included unexpected element positions and inconsistent state rendering, which led to incorrect element selection. Additionally, website interaction traps involved case-sensitive input fields (e.g., 'Central New York' vs. 'CENTRAL NEW YARK') and hidden or dynamically loaded elements that were not captured in the HTML, causing action failures. To succeed, ensure exact case matching for input fields and account for dynamically rendered elements that may not be visible in static HTML."
      }
