      "payload": {
        "scenario_description": "cargurus",
        "memory_description": "Cargurus website has inconsistent UI element positioning and unclear interaction logic for vehicle search filters.",
        "content_body": "On Cargurus, the UI layout pitfalls include unexpected placement of year filters, which may not be where the user expects based on prior experience with similar sites. Additionally, the website interaction traps involve incorrect dropdown selections for vehicle years, where the available options may not match the expected values (e.g., selecting 2012 instead of 2013). Users must carefully verify the dropdown options and ensure they select the correct year from the list, as the system does not always allow direct typing of the desired year into the field."
      }
