      "payload": {
        "scenario_description": "travelzoo",
        "memory_description": "Travelzoo website has dynamic UI elements and inconsistent element IDs that cause task failure.",
        "content_body": "On the Travelzoo website, UI layout pitfalls include unexpected element positions and dynamic content rendering, which made it difficult to locate the correct elements for Disney theme parks with water rides. Additionally, website interaction traps involve inconsistent element IDs and hidden or skipped steps in the task trajectory, such as when the ground truth click targets were not present in the cleaned HTML. Correct interaction requires precise element targeting and awareness of dynamic content updates, which were not reliably captured during the task execution."
      }
