        "scenario_description": "agoda",
        "memory_description": "Agoda website has dynamic UI elements and inconsistent interaction patterns that lead to task failure.",
        "content_body": "On Agoda, UI layout pitfalls include dynamically loaded elements and non-static element IDs, which make it difficult to reliably select the correct components during task execution. Additionally, website interaction traps involve the absence of direct 'pay-later' filters in the booking process, requiring users to navigate through hidden or non-obvious options, such as selecting 'No Payment Required' during checkout or adjusting payment preferences in account settings. These factors contribute to failed task steps and inconsistent interaction success rates."
      }
