        "scenario_description": "instacart",
        "memory_description": "Instacart website has layout and interaction inconsistencies that hinder task completion.",
        "content_body": "On Instacart, UI layout pitfalls include unexpected placement of interactive elements, such as Costco deal links not being in the expected location within the page structure. Additionally, website interaction traps involve actions failing due to dynamic content loading or elements not being rendered in the cleaned HTML, such as the missing CLICK [4830] target in the third step. Users must ensure they wait for full page load and verify element presence before interacting, as automated steps may fail if elements are not yet available or are dynamically generated."
      }
