      "payload": {
        "scenario_description": "aa",
        "memory_description": "Flight booking website 'aa' has inconsistent UI layout and unclear interaction patterns leading to task failure.",
        "content_body": "The website 'aa' presents UI layout pitfalls where elements such as input fields and buttons are not consistently positioned or labeled, leading to incorrect element selection (e.g., selecting a dropdown instead of typing a destination). Additionally, interaction traps include unexpected behavior in form fields (e.g., selecting a passenger count instead of typing the correct value) and mismatched action targets (e.g., clicking on a non-interactive element instead of the intended button). These issues caused multiple steps in the booking task to fail, particularly when specifying the destination, passenger count, and proceeding through the booking flow."
      }
    },
