      "payload": {
        "scenario_description": "carmax",
        "memory_description": "The Carmax website dynamically changes element IDs during the search process, making previously recorded element IDs obsolete or incorrect for subsequent steps.",
        "content_body": "On the Carmax website, element IDs for interactive components such as search filters, location inputs, and vehicle type selectors are not static. During the search process, these IDs can change dynamically, which leads to failed interactions when relying on previously recorded or fixed element identifiers. For example, attempting to click on an element with an ID like [3658] may no longer be valid in later steps of the task, as the website regenerates or reassigns IDs based on user actions or content updates. This dynamic behavior requires real-time element identification or adaptive interaction strategies to ensure task success."
      }
