        "scenario_description": "redbox",
        "memory_description": "The Redbox website lacks a visible and accessible genre filter option in the newly released movies section, preventing users from effectively narrowing down their search to a specific genre like comedy.",
        "content_body": "On the Redbox website, when browsing newly released movies, users are unable to filter by genre because the genre filter functionality is either missing or not properly rendered in the UI. This absence of a genre filter makes it impossible to locate comedy movies for rental, even if the user knows the general layout of the site. The filter options are not present in the cleaned HTML, and no alternative pathways for genre-based navigation are available, leading to task failure."
