      "payload": {
        "scenario_description": "resy",
        "memory_description": "The Resy website's search and filter UI elements are inconsistently labeled and positioned, leading to incorrect selection of restaurant categories and time slots.",
        "content_body": "On the Resy website, the UI for filtering restaurants by cuisine type (e.g., Malaysian) and time of day (e.g., dinner after 9 pm) is not consistently labeled or placed, which can lead to incorrect selections. Additionally, the search results may not clearly display the restaurant's rating or availability, making it difficult to identify top-rated new restaurants. Users may also encounter issues with time selection, as the interface for specifying dates and times can be ambiguous or non-intuitive, especially when booking for specific meal periods like lunch or dinner."
      }
    },
