      "payload": {
        "scenario_description": "ikea",
        "memory_description": "The IKEA website's product filtering and sorting mechanisms are not intuitive, making it difficult to isolate and compare top-rated solid wood bedroom nightstands.",
        "content_body": "On the IKEA website, users attempting to find and compare products face challenges with the product listing interface. Specifically, the 'solid wood' filter may not be clearly labeled or may not apply correctly to bedroom nightstands, leading to irrelevant or incomplete results. Additionally, the sorting by 'highest-rated' does not consistently display the top three products in a clear, selectable format. Users must manually inspect product cards and note ratings, which is error-prone and inefficient. The comparison feature is also limited, as it does not allow direct side-by-side comparison of product attributes, requiring users to navigate back and forth between product pages to identify differences."
      }
    },
