      "payload": {
        "scenario_description": "apple",
        "memory_description": "The Apple website's dynamic loading of product accessories and configuration options caused failure in selecting all required items.",
        "content_body": "On the Apple website, when adding the Pro Display XDR with nano texture to the bag, the accessories and configuration options are dynamically loaded and not always visible in the initial HTML structure. This means that standard interaction paths may not capture all necessary elements, such as checkboxes or dropdowns for accessories, which are only accessible after specific user interactions or page updates. Users must ensure they fully expand or interact with configuration sections to reveal all available accessories before proceeding to add the item to the bag."
      }
