      "payload": {
        "scenario_description": "espn",
        "memory_description": "ESPN's date filters may not be accessible via direct element clicks due to hidden or dynamically rendered calendar widgets.",
        "content_body": "On the ESPN website, when attempting to filter schedules by a specific date like April 8th, 2023, the date selection is often embedded in a dynamically rendered calendar widget that is not directly clickable via standard element IDs. This widget may not be visible in the static HTML or may require additional interaction (e.g., expanding a date picker) before the desired date can be selected. Users must first interact with a date picker or calendar control before selecting a specific date, as direct clicks on date elements may fail if the calendar is not fully rendered or exposed in the DOM."
      }
    },
