      "payload": {
        "scenario_description": "kbb",
        "memory_description": "The KBB website requires a specific sequence of actions to apply both make/model/year filters and sorting options, which was not previously documented.",
        "content_body": "On the KBB website, when browsing used cars, applying filters such as make (e.g., Mercedes), year range (e.g., 2004–2012), and sorting by highest price requires a specific interaction sequence. First, the user must click the 'Sort By' button, not directly select a sorting option from a dropdown. Then, the user must apply the year range filter by clicking the 'Year' filter button and selecting the desired range. Finally, the user must explicitly choose the 'Price: High to Low' sorting option from the 'Sort By' menu. Failure to follow this exact sequence results in incomplete or incorrect filtering and sorting."
      }
    },
