      "payload": {
        "scenario_description": "exploretock",
        "memory_description": "The website requires clicking a 'Search' button before selecting a location, which is not explicitly labeled or positioned predictably.",
        "content_body": "Exploretock is a restaurant discovery and reservation platform with inconsistent UI elements and non-standard interaction patterns. One specific issue is that users must click a 'Search' button (often unlabeled or mispositioned) before being able to select a location or input a city like 'New Delhi'. This hidden step is not clearly indicated, leading to task failures when users attempt to type a location directly without first initiating a search."
      }
