        "scenario_description": "ultimate-guitar",
        "memory_description": "The website's comment upvoting mechanism is not consistently accessible via direct navigation from chord or tab pages, requiring an indirect or non-obvious path.",
        "content_body": "On ultimate-guitar.com, upvoting a comment on a specific chord or tab page often requires navigating through additional layers of content or using a non-intuitive path, as direct upvoting options are not always visible or accessible from the main chord/tab view. Users may need to locate a dedicated comments section or forum thread related to the chord or tab, which may not be immediately apparent due to inconsistent UI design and unclear navigation cues."
