      "payload": {
        "scenario_description": "koa",
        "memory_description": "The website requires selecting a date range and number of nights before clicking the search button, not just the zip code.",
        "content_body": "Koa is a deals/offer website where users can find hot deals on vacation rentals. To successfully browse sites with specific criteria like a hot tub for three nights starting on June 20th, users must first type a zip code into the search box and click the search button. However, additional filters such as dates and number of nights must be selected from specific UI elements (e.g., date pickers or night counters) before clicking the search button again. These filters are not automatically applied by just entering the zip code, and failing to set them results in incomplete or incorrect search results. The search button must be clicked after all filters are set for the query to execute properly."
      }
    },
