      "payload": {
        "scenario_description": "budget",
        "memory_description": "The website does not allow filtering by vehicle type (e.g., SUVs & Wagons) directly on the search results page, requiring users to navigate through an additional step or use a different interface element.",
        "content_body": "On the Budget website, when searching for car rentals, users cannot directly filter results by vehicle type (such as SUVs or Wagons) on the initial search results page. Instead, they must first select a car and then navigate to a separate section or use a hidden filter option that is not clearly labeled or accessible through standard search parameters. This behavior is not intuitive and was not previously documented, leading to task failure when attempting to apply vehicle-type filters during the search process."
      }
