      "payload": {
        "scenario_description": "delta",
        "memory_description": "The website requires explicit selection of 'First Class' via a dropdown menu rather than a click on a label or text element.",
        "content_body": "On Delta Airlines' website, when selecting a class of service such as 'First Class,' users must interact with a dropdown menu or select element, not a static label or text. For example, clicking on a label like 'First Class' will not trigger the selection; instead, the user must click on the dropdown arrow or select element associated with the class field and then choose 'First Class' from the list of options. This behavior differs from standard form interactions and must be explicitly followed to ensure the correct class is applied to the flight search."
      }
    },
