      "payload": {
        "scenario_description": "imdb",
        "memory_description": "The IMDb website's movie rating interface requires navigating to a specific 'Rate' section that is not immediately visible in the initial view or standard search results.",
        "content_body": "On IMDb, when attempting to rate a movie like 'The Terminator II: Judgement Day,' the 'Rate' button or interface is not directly accessible from the initial search results or movie detail page. Users must locate and click on a 'Rate' link or section, which may be hidden or require scrolling, expanding, or navigating through additional menus. This hidden interaction element can lead to task failure if the user assumes the rating interface is immediately visible or accessible without additional navigation."
      }
