      "payload": {
        "scenario_description": "tvguide",
        "memory_description": "The TV Guide website does not provide a direct link to a director's filmography from a specific show page, requiring users to infer or search for additional information.",
        "content_body": "On the TV Guide website, when viewing a show page such as 'Smile,' there is no direct link or section that lists other films directed by the same director. Users must either search for the director's name using the site's search bar or navigate through unrelated sections, which are not clearly labeled or organized by director. This lack of a centralized or direct access point to a director's filmography increases the difficulty of completing tasks that require finding related works."
      }
