      "payload": {
        "scenario_description": "airbnb",
        "memory_description": "Failure to account for dynamically hidden modals when specifying group size and date for online experiences.",
        "content_body": "On Airbnb, when searching for online experiences, specifying the number of participants (e.g., 4 people) and selecting a date (e.g., May 10) may require interaction with dynamically hidden modals or dropdowns that are not directly accessible in the static HTML structure. For example, after selecting the 'Online Experiences' category, the group size and date selection may be embedded in hidden modals or require additional navigation steps that are not captured in the element ID mapping. To successfully apply these filters, users must explicitly navigate through these hidden UI elements, which are not visible in the cleaned HTML and can lead to task failure if not accounted for."
      }
    },
