        "scenario_description": "new.mta.info",
        "memory_description": "The website new.mta.info requires specific date formatting for trip planning that is not intuitive or clearly indicated in the UI.",
        "content_body": "On new.mta.info, when planning a trip, the date input fields require a specific format (e.g., 'MM/DD/YYYY') that is not clearly labeled or hinted at in the UI. For example, entering 'April 12' as 'April 12' or '12 April' may fail if the system expects '04/12/2025' instead. This lack of clear formatting guidance and the absence of a calendar picker make it difficult for users to input the correct date for trip planning tasks."
      }
    },
