        "scenario_description": "redbox",
        "memory_description": "The Redbox website lacks a visible and accessible filter or search option for devices that support Live TV on demand streaming.",
        "content_body": "On the Redbox website, users attempting to find devices that support Live TV on demand streaming encounter obstacles due to the absence of a dedicated filter or search functionality for device capabilities. The UI does not provide a clear pathway to identify or select devices based on their support for Live TV streaming, and such options are not present in the cleaned HTML. This omission prevents users from completing the task, even if they are familiar with the general layout of the site."
