      "payload": {
        "scenario_description": "eventbrite",
        "memory_description": "Eventbrite's category filters require explicit selection from a dropdown, not direct text input, which was not previously documented.",
        "content_body": "On Eventbrite, when searching for events in a specific category like 'performing and visual arts,' the website does not allow direct text input into the category field. Instead, users must explicitly select the category from a dropdown menu. This behavior differs from standard search interfaces where categories can be typed directly. Failure to use the dropdown results in incorrect or incomplete event listings, even if location and date filters are correctly applied."
      }
    },
