      "payload": {
        "scenario_description": "nyc",
        "memory_description": "The 'nyc' website requires clicking on dynamically generated elements for filtering city tours, which were not previously documented.",
        "content_body": "On the 'nyc' website, when attempting to show the best city tours, users must click on dynamically generated elements (not present in the cleaned HTML) to apply filters. These elements are not consistently labeled or positioned, making it difficult to identify them during task execution. This behavior differs from static UI elements and was not previously recorded, leading to task failure when attempting to interact with visible or labeled components instead."
      }
