        "content_body": "On SoundCloud, to create a new playlist named 'Meditation Music', you must navigate to the 'Playlists' section of your profile or use the dedicated 'Create Playlist' interface, rather than attempting to create it directly from a track page. This process is not automatically triggered by typing the playlist name into a field or clicking a generic 'Add to Playlist' option. Additionally, the 'Add to Playlist' functionality may not be available on all track pages, requiring users to explicitly access the playlist management interface to create or add tracks to a playlist."
