      "payload": {
        "scenario_description": "uniqlo",
        "memory_description": "Uniqlo's return policy instructions are not directly accessible via a dedicated 'Return Policy' link but require navigating through account-specific sections or order history.",
        "content_body": "On the Uniqlo website, instructions for returning orders online are not found in a standalone 'Return Policy' section. Instead, they are embedded within the 'My Account' or 'Order History' sections after logging in. To locate return instructions, first log into your account, then navigate to 'Order History' and select a specific order. From there, look for a 'Return' or 'Exchange' option linked to the order. This process is not intuitive and requires account access, which may not be obvious to users unfamiliar with the site's structure."
      }
