        "scenario_description": "spothero",
        "memory_description": "The search input for location and date fields requires exact case sensitivity and specific element interaction not previously documented.",
        "content_body": "On Spothero, when searching for parking options, the location and date fields have strict interaction rules. For example, typing 'Florida Keys' in the location field must match the exact case used by the system, and the date input may require a click action instead of typing directly. Additionally, the system may not accept certain date formats unless explicitly selected from a calendar widget, which is not always visible. These nuances are critical for successful task completion and were not previously captured in existing knowledge."
      }
