        "scenario_description": "last.fm",
        "memory_description": "The homepage's 'first recommended song' may not be directly clickable or identifiable via standard element IDs due to dynamic content loading and UI layering.",
        "content_body": "On last.fm, the first recommended song on the homepage may not be directly accessible via standard element IDs or positions because the homepage dynamically loads content and uses layered UI components. To successfully set a song as a current obsession, you must first ensure that the recommended song is fully loaded and visible in the UI, then locate the 'Set as Current Obsession' button associated with that specific song. This button may be nested within a card or modal that requires interaction with the song element first, which is not always captured by static element IDs or positions."
