        "memory_description": "The IGN website lacks explicit filtering options for 'free with IGN Plus rewards' games, leading to incomplete or incorrect result sets.",
        "content_body": "On the IGN website, there is no direct filter or search option to identify games that are free with IGN Plus rewards. Users attempting to find such games may encounter incomplete or irrelevant results because the 'IGN Plus' or 'free with subscription' status is not clearly marked in search or browse interfaces. To successfully locate these games, users must manually check game details pages or look for explicit labels such as 'Free with IGN Plus' in the game description or pricing section."
