      "payload": {
        "scenario_description": "qatarairways",
        "memory_description": "The Qatar Airways website lacks clear visual indicators for the travel requirements check button, leading to confusion in the final step of the task.",
        "content_body": "On the Qatar Airways website, when attempting to find travel requirements from Amsterdam to Cairo, users may encounter confusion in the final step due to the absence of clear visual indicators for the correct button to proceed. Despite correctly clicking on the expected elements in earlier steps, the final submission button may be visually indistinct from other buttons, making it difficult to identify. This lack of differentiation can lead to task failure, as users may inadvertently select the wrong button. It is important to carefully inspect the screen for any subtle cues or labels that distinguish the correct button for submitting the travel requirement check."
      }
    },
