      "payload": {
        "scenario_description": "rentalcars",
        "memory_description": "The website's date and time selection fields for drop-off are not properly labeled or accessible, leading to incorrect selections.",
        "content_body": "On rentalcars.com, when attempting to select the drop-off date and time, the time field for drop-off is either not properly labeled, not rendered in the DOM, or obscured by other UI elements, making it impossible to interact with using standard selection actions. This results in the inability to correctly set the drop-off time, even if the user navigates to the correct section of the page. The correct interaction involves locating the drop-off time field, which may be hidden or mislabeled, and ensuring the correct time (e.g., 11:00 AM) is selected after the date has been set."
      }
