      "payload": {
        "scenario_description": "kayak",
        "memory_description": "The Kayak website does not provide a direct interface for tracking specific flights by flight number and date, requiring users to infer or navigate through unclear options.",
        "content_body": "On the Kayak website, users attempting to track a specific flight (e.g., Qatar Airways flight D145 on April 18th) encounter a lack of a dedicated 'Track Flight' or 'Flight Status' feature. The website does not provide a clear input field or button for entering a flight number and date to check its status. Instead, users must infer how to proceed, often leading to failed interactions because the necessary UI elements are either missing or not logically grouped. This absence of a direct tracking interface represents a specific pitfall for users seeking real-time flight information."
      }
    },
