        "scenario_description": "apple",
        "memory_description": "Apple website: Hidden or dynamically loaded sections for product comparisons and specific model details (e.g., Ultra version) prevent accurate element selection.",
        "content_body": "On the Apple website, when attempting to compare Apple Watches or learn more about the Ultra version, critical sections such as comparison tools or model-specific details are often hidden or dynamically loaded and not present in the initial HTML structure. This means that standard interaction paths may not reveal these elements, and users must explicitly navigate to the 'Apple Watch' section, select the Ultra model, and interact with comparison features (e.g., expanding tabs or clicking 'Learn More') to access the necessary information. Failure to engage with these dynamic elements results in inability to locate or click on the correct content."
      }
