      "payload": {
        "scenario_description": "flightaware",
        "memory_description": "FlightAware's AeroAPI plan comparison section uses dynamically generated tabs or sections that are not consistently accessible via standard navigation methods.",
        "content_body": "On FlightAware, when attempting to compare available plans for the AeroAPI, the website dynamically generates tabs or sections that may not be accessible through standard click interactions or may require specific triggers (like hover, scroll, or form submission) to become visible. This behavior can lead to failed interactions if the automation assumes static tab structures or does not account for conditional rendering of plan comparison content. To successfully navigate this section, ensure that all dynamic tabs or sections are fully rendered and consider using interaction methods that simulate user behavior, such as scrolling or triggering visibility conditions, before attempting to click on or compare plan details."
      }
    },
