        "scenario_description": "ryanair",
        "memory_description": "The Ryanair website does not support booking hotel accommodations, leading to task failure when attempting to book hotel rooms.",
        "content_body": "The Ryanair website is designed exclusively for booking flights and related travel services, such as baggage and seat selection. It does not provide functionality for booking hotel rooms or accommodations. Attempts to book hotel rooms on the Ryanair website will result in task failure, as the necessary UI elements, forms, and interaction pathways for hotel reservations are not present on the site."
