      "payload": {
        "scenario_description": "espn",
        "memory_description": "ESPN's channel-specific filters (e.g., ESPN2) may be nested within interactive menus that require prior expansion or hover actions before becoming selectable.",
        "content_body": "On the ESPN website, when attempting to filter for upcoming soccer events on ESPN2, the 'ESPN2' channel option may be hidden within a dropdown or interactive menu that requires an initial click or hover action to expand. This means that directly selecting the 'ESPN2' option without first interacting with the parent menu will fail. Users must first trigger the menu (e.g., by clicking a 'Channel' or 'Network' filter button) to expose the 'ESPN2' option before it can be selected. This behavior is not always visually indicated, making it easy to overlook the necessary interaction step."
      }
    },
