      "payload": {
        "scenario_description": "kbb",
        "memory_description": "The KBB website requires a specific sequence to apply location filters and schedule test drives, which was not previously documented.",
        "content_body": "On the KBB website, when searching for vehicles within a specific zip code and scheduling a test drive, the correct interaction sequence involves first entering the zip code in the 'Location' field, then selecting the radius (e.g., '10 Miles') from the corresponding dropdown. To schedule a test drive, the user must click the 'Schedule Test Drive' button, not type directly into a hidden field. After selecting the desired date and time, the user must explicitly click the 'Submit' or 'Confirm' button to finalize the request. Failure to follow this exact sequence results in incomplete or incorrect location filtering and test drive scheduling."
      }
    },
