        "content_body": "On the 'united' website, when searching for flights that can be booked using miles, a hidden toggle or filter must be engaged to reveal such options. This toggle is not clearly labeled or positioned in the UI, and its activation is not indicated by standard visual cues. Users must locate and interact with this hidden element to filter results to only those bookable with miles, which is not part of the visible or expected interaction flow."
