      "payload": {
        "scenario_description": "agoda",
        "memory_description": "Agoda's flight booking interface uses session-specific element IDs and requires precise date formatting that differs from standard input expectations.",
        "content_body": "On Agoda, when booking flights, the website assigns unique, session-specific IDs to interactive elements such as date pickers and booking buttons, which change between user sessions. Additionally, the date input field requires a specific date format (e.g., '24/04' instead of 'April 24') that is not clearly indicated on the page. These factors make it difficult to reliably interact with the flight booking interface, leading to task failures when relying on static element IDs or non-standard date formats."
      }
    },
