      "payload": {
        "scenario_description": "koa",
        "memory_description": "The website requires selecting check-in and check-out dates using specific date picker elements before clicking the search button, not just typing the zip code.",
        "content_body": "Koa is a deals/offer website for vacation rentals and campgrounds. To find a campground in Orlando for 2 adults with check-in on March 29 and check-out on March 30, users must first type the zip code into the search box and click the search button. However, additional filters such as check-in and check-out dates must be selected using specific date picker UI elements before clicking the search button again. These date pickers are typically labeled with text like 'Check-in' and 'Check-out' and are located near the search box or in a dedicated filter section. The search button must be clicked after all filters, including dates and number of guests, are set for the query to execute properly. Failing to set these filters results in incomplete or incorrect search results."
      }
