        "content_body": "The parking website contains a search form where the ZIP code input field is either mislabeled, hidden, or not clearly associated with the location parameter. This causes users to either skip the ZIP code input or enter it in the wrong field, resulting in failed or inaccurate search results. The correct input for location (ZIP code) is not consistently positioned or labeled, and users must manually inspect the form elements to identify the correct field for entering '10001' or any other ZIP code."
