      "payload": {
        "scenario_description": "marriott",
        "memory_description": "The Marriott website requires users to select a gift card theme from a hidden submenu before proceeding with purchase, which is not clearly indicated in the UI.",
        "content_body": "On the Marriott website, when attempting to buy a gift card with a beach theme, users must first navigate to a hidden submenu or section dedicated to gift card themes. This submenu is not clearly labeled or visible in the main gift card purchase flow, leading to task failure if users assume they can directly select or input the theme during the initial steps. The beach theme option is only accessible after clicking on a 'Select Theme' or similar button that is not prominently displayed, making it easy to overlook during the purchase process."
      }
    },
