      "payload": {
        "scenario_description": "budget",
        "memory_description": "The website requires clicking a calendar icon to select dates, not typing or selecting from a dropdown directly.",
        "content_body": "On the Budget website, when selecting pickup and return dates for car rentals, users must click a calendar icon to open a date picker interface. Direct typing of dates or selecting from a dropdown is not supported. This behavior is not intuitive and was not previously documented, leading to task failure when attempting to input dates through standard text fields or dropdown selections."
      }
