      "payload": {
        "scenario_description": "ticketcenter",
        "memory_description": "The ticketcenter website requires users to explicitly select a date filter from a non-intuitive calendar widget, which is not accessible via direct text input or standard date range fields.",
        "content_body": "On the ticketcenter website, when searching for events on a specific date such as Sunday, April 16, users cannot directly type the date into a visible input field. Instead, they must locate and interact with a hidden or dynamically loaded calendar widget, which is not clearly labeled or accessible via typical click actions. For example, to select April 16, a user must navigate to the date filter section, open the calendar, and click on the desired date. This behavior is inconsistent with standard UI expectations and can lead to task failure if not properly accounted for."
      }
