      "payload": {
        "scenario_description": "sixflags",
        "memory_description": "The Sixflags website has inconsistent ride category navigation, where family ride sections may be nested or hidden under dynamic menus that are not always visible or accessible via direct element selection.",
        "content_body": "On the Sixflags website, ride categories such as 'Family Rides' at Frontier City may be located within dynamically generated or collapsible navigation menus that do not appear in the initial page layout. Attempting to directly select ride elements without first expanding or navigating through these menus can result in incorrect or incomplete ride listings. Users must ensure they fully interact with navigation elements to reveal hidden or nested ride categories before attempting to select or view family ride options."
      }
