        "scenario_description": "imdb",
        "memory_description": "The IMDb website's 'Crazy Credits' section for a movie is not directly accessible from the main movie detail page and requires navigating to a hidden or non-obvious section.",
        "content_body": "On IMDb, when attempting to view the 'Crazy Credits' for a movie like 'Prometheus,' the link or section containing this information is not immediately visible on the main movie detail page. Users must scroll through the page or navigate to a specific section, such as the 'More Info' or 'Credits' tab, to locate the 'Crazy Credits' link. This hidden interaction element can lead to task failure if the user assumes the 'Crazy Credits' are directly accessible without additional navigation or scrolling."
