        "scenario_description": "new.mta.info",
        "memory_description": "The website new.mta.info has a navigable path to neighborhood maps in Brooklyn through a sequence of specific clickable elements.",
        "content_body": "On new.mta.info, users can access the list of all neighborhood maps for Brooklyn by following a specific sequence of three clickable elements. The first click targets an element with ID [184], which likely leads to a section related to maps or locations. The second click targets element [3889], which may open a sub-menu or category listing, and the third click on element [5627] directly accesses the desired list of Brooklyn neighborhood maps. This sequence suggests a structured navigation path that is not previously documented and may be useful for users seeking geographic information about Brooklyn."
