      "payload": {
        "scenario_description": "redbox",
        "memory_description": "The Redbox website lacks a visible and accessible 'Add to Wishlist' button for individual movies, preventing users from completing the task even when the movie is located.",
        "content_body": "On the Redbox website, users attempting to add a movie like 'The Shawshank Redemption' to their wishlist face a critical obstacle: the absence of a visible and accessible 'Add to Wishlist' button for individual movie entries. Despite being able to locate the movie title and navigate to its detail page, the expected action element (e.g., a button or link labeled 'Add to Wishlist') is either missing from the UI or not rendered in the cleaned HTML. This omission creates a functional gap that prevents users from completing the task, even if they are familiar with the general layout of the site."
      }
