      "payload": {
        "scenario_description": "eventbrite",
        "memory_description": "Eventbrite's search requires explicit use of 'food festivals' as a category filter, not just location and date.",
        "content_body": "On Eventbrite, when searching for events like 'food festivals' in a specific location (e.g., Colorado) and time frame (e.g., this weekend), it is necessary to explicitly select the 'food festivals' category from a dropdown menu, not just type it into the search field. Simply entering location and date without selecting the correct category from the filter dropdown will result in incomplete or incorrect event listings. This behavior is not intuitive and differs from standard search interfaces where categories can be typed directly."
      }
    },
