      "payload": {
        "scenario_description": "soundcloud",
        "memory_description": "Filtering by a tag on SoundCloud requires an explicit action to apply the tag after typing it, not just entering the tag in a field.",
        "content_body": "On SoundCloud, when attempting to filter playlists by a tag like #Dance & edm, simply typing the tag into a search or filter field does not automatically apply the filter. Instead, the user must explicitly select or confirm the tag from a dropdown or tag list that appears after typing. This behavior is not intuitive and differs from general website conventions where typing a tag might be sufficient to trigger a filter. Additionally, the filtered results may not be immediately available in the DOM due to dynamic loading, requiring delays or rechecks for element presence before interaction."
      }
    },
