      "payload": {
        "scenario_description": "discogs",
        "memory_description": "The 'Shipped From' filter requires explicit selection from a dropdown, not direct text input or assumed location.",
        "content_body": "On Discogs, when attempting to filter items by shipping origin (e.g., 'Germany'), the 'Shipped From' filter is not a visible text field but a dropdown menu that must be explicitly clicked and selected from. This means users cannot type directly into a field to set the location; instead, they must locate the 'Shipped From' dropdown, click it to reveal options, and then select 'Germany' from the list. Failure to interact with the dropdown in this way will result in the filter not being applied, leading to incorrect or incomplete search results."
      }
    },
