      "payload": {
        "scenario_description": "menards",
        "memory_description": "The Menards website dynamically loads location-based content, such as weekly ads, and requires explicit store selection before ad data becomes available in the DOM.",
        "content_body": "On the Menards website, when attempting to find the weekly ad for the store closest to a specific zip code (e.g., 82718), the relevant content is not immediately present in the HTML. The weekly ad information only becomes available in the DOM after a store is explicitly selected based on the zip code. This dynamic loading behavior means that attempting to interact with elements before store selection will result in missing elements and failed interactions. To successfully complete the task, the user must first enter the zip code and select the corresponding store, ensuring that the weekly ad content is loaded into the DOM before attempting to access or click on it."
      }
    },
