      "payload": {
        "scenario_description": "ryanair",
        "memory_description": "The Ryanair website lacks a dedicated hotel booking section, and the task was incorrectly assumed to be possible through the same interface used for flight bookings.",
        "content_body": "The Ryanair website is designed exclusively for booking flights, additional flight services (such as baggage and seat selection), and related travel products. It does not include functionality for booking hotel accommodations. Users attempting to book hotels on the Ryanair website will encounter missing UI elements, non-existent forms, and no interaction pathways for hotel reservations. This limitation is not clearly communicated on the site, leading to task failure when users assume hotel booking is supported."
      }
    },
