      "payload": {
        "scenario_description": "espn",
        "memory_description": "ESPN's team-specific filters (e.g., 'Brooklyn Nets') may be nested within interactive menus that require prior expansion or hover actions before becoming selectable.",
        "content_body": "On the ESPN website, when attempting to find the team schedule of the Brooklyn Nets, the 'Brooklyn Nets' team option may be hidden within a dropdown or interactive menu that requires an initial click or hover action to expand. This means that directly selecting the 'Brooklyn Nets' option without first interacting with the parent menu will fail. Users must first trigger the menu (e.g., by clicking a 'Team' or 'Sports' filter button) to expose the 'Brooklyn Nets' option before it can be selected. This behavior is not always visually indicated, making it easy to overlook the necessary interaction step."
      }
    },
