        "scenario_description": "united",
        "memory_description": "The 'united' website requires specific selection of 'vacation package' filters through a hidden toggle or filter that is not visually apparent or accessible via standard interaction patterns.",
        "content_body": "On the 'united' website, when searching for vacation packages that include flights, hotels, and cars with specific criteria (such as basic economy fares, 4 and 5-star hotels, and casino access), a hidden toggle or filter must be engaged to reveal such options. This toggle is not clearly labeled or positioned in the UI, and its activation is not indicated by standard visual cues. Users must locate and interact with this hidden element to filter results to only those matching the specified vacation package criteria, which is not part of the visible or expected interaction flow."
