      "payload": {
        "scenario_description": "kohls",
        "memory_description": "Kohls website has non-static clearance filter visibility and inconsistent application order for category and size filters, leading to failed clearance browsing tasks.",
        "content_body": "On Kohls.com, when attempting to browse men's winter coats in size large that is on clearance, the clearance filter may not be consistently visible or accessible in the same location, and the order in which filters (such as category and size) are applied can vary dynamically. This makes it unreliable to assume a specific path or sequence for reaching the clearance section and applying filters like 'men's winter coats' and 'size large.' Users must manually locate the clearance filter and reapply filters in a specific order, which may not be intuitive or consistent across sessions."
      }
