      "payload": {
        "scenario_description": "budget",
        "memory_description": "The website requires selecting a specific airport location from a dropdown list, not typing the full airport name directly into a location field.",
        "content_body": "On the Budget website, when selecting a car rental pickup location, users must choose from a predefined list of airports rather than typing the full airport name (e.g., 'Birmingham-Shuttlesworth Intl, Birmingham, AL, United States-(BHM)'). The location input field does not support direct text entry of full airport names or addresses; instead, it requires selecting an option from a dropdown or list of available locations. This behavior was not previously documented and led to task failure when attempting to input the airport name directly."
      }
