        "content_body": "On the Budget website, when searching for car rentals with a partner AARP SUV deal discount, users must click a specific 'AARP SUV deal' filter button that is not clearly labeled or visible on the search results page. This filter is not accessible through standard search parameters or vehicle-type dropdowns, and its presence is not indicated until after a car is selected. This behavior is not intuitive and was not previously documented, leading to task failure when attempting to apply the AARP SUV deal filter during the search process."
