        "scenario_description": "budget",
        "memory_description": "The website does not allow filtering for 'free SUV upgrade' or 'pay-later' options directly on the search results page, requiring users to navigate through additional hidden or non-intuitive steps.",
        "content_body": "On the Budget website, when searching for car rentals, users cannot directly filter results by 'free SUV upgrade' or 'pay-later' options on the initial search results page. These filters are not available through standard search parameters or visible interface elements. Instead, users must navigate through additional hidden steps or sections to access these options, which are not clearly labeled or documented. This behavior is not intuitive and can lead to task failure when attempting to apply these specific filters during the search process."
