      "payload": {
        "scenario_description": "sixflags",
        "memory_description": "The Sixflags website has inconsistent element visibility and dynamic rendering of add-on product options, leading to missed or incorrect selection of go-cart pass add-ons.",
        "content_body": "On the Sixflags website, add-on product options such as all-season go-cart passes may be dynamically rendered or conditionally displayed based on user interactions, making them invisible or inaccessible during initial page loads. Attempting to select these options without first triggering their visibility through specific navigation or selection steps can result in failed interactions. Users must ensure they navigate through relevant sections or trigger visibility conditions before attempting to select or add go-cart pass add-ons to the cart."
      }
