      "payload": {
        "scenario_description": "newegg",
        "memory_description": "Newegg's search result sorting options and product selection are inconsistently rendered, leading to misidentification of 'most reviews' and incorrect item targeting.",
        "content_body": "On Newegg, when attempting to sort products by 'most reviews' or select items from search results, the UI elements for sorting options and product listings are not consistently rendered or labeled. This can lead to incorrect sorting application or selection of the wrong items, especially when relying on static or position-based targeting. Users should verify the visible labels and functional behavior of sorting options and product items dynamically, as the site may shift or re-render elements unpredictably, affecting the accuracy of automation or manual selection."
      }
