        "content_body": "On Newegg, when attempting to sort search results by 'Lowest Price', the corresponding UI element is not consistently labeled or accessible in the HTML structure. This makes it difficult to reliably select the 'Lowest Price' option, especially when relying on static or position-based targeting. Users should avoid assuming fixed element positions or IDs and instead use dynamic or attribute-based selection methods to interact with sorting options, ensuring that the correct option is selected based on visible labels and functional behavior."
