      "payload": {
        "scenario_description": "eventbrite",
        "memory_description": "Eventbrite's 'free' filter must be explicitly selected from a hidden filter menu, not just inferred from search terms or category selections.",
        "content_body": "On Eventbrite, when searching for free events like 'fashion conventions' in a specific location (e.g., San Francisco), it is necessary to explicitly select the 'free' filter from a hidden or secondary filter menu, not just type it into the search field or assume it is included by default. Simply entering location and category without selecting the 'free' filter from the filter dropdown will result in incorrect or incomplete event listings. This behavior is not intuitive and differs from standard search interfaces where filters can be inferred or typed directly."
      }
