        "scenario_description": "foxsports",
        "memory_description": "The FoxSports website has inconsistent element identifiers for accessing team-specific schedules, leading to incorrect element selection during schedule checks.",
        "content_body": "On the FoxSports website, the elements used to access the schedule for specific MLB teams like the New York Yankees are not consistently labeled or positioned across different pages or sessions. This inconsistency makes it difficult to reliably select the correct element for viewing the Yankees' schedule. The correct interaction involves locating a menu or section labeled 'Schedule,' 'MLB,' or 'Yankees,' which may be nested within a sports-specific navigation bar, a dropdown menu, or a dedicated team page. Clicking the correct link or button is required, rather than typing or selecting unrelated elements."
      }
    },
