      "payload": {
        "scenario_description": "last.fm",
        "memory_description": "The 'Share on Twitter' button for events is not consistently located in predictable UI sections and may require navigating to a specific event page first.",
        "content_body": "On last.fm, to share a Blackpink event on Twitter, you must first navigate to the specific event page by searching for 'Blackpink' and selecting the relevant event from the results. The 'Share on Twitter' button is typically located on the event page itself, not on the search or homepage. This button may not be accessible via direct element IDs or positions due to dynamic content loading and UI layering. Ensure the event page is fully loaded and visible before attempting to locate and click the 'Share on Twitter' button."
      }
    },
