      "payload": {
        "scenario_description": "discogs",
        "memory_description": "The 'Join Group' action requires navigating to a specific group's page first, rather than being available directly from the search results.",
        "content_body": "On Discogs, after searching for groups related to a topic like 'rap,' the 'Join Group' option is not available directly from the search results page. Instead, you must click on the specific group name in the search results to navigate to its dedicated page, where the 'Join Group' button is located. Attempting to 'join' a group without first visiting its individual page will result in failure, as the necessary interaction element is not present in the search results view."
      }
