      "payload": {
        "scenario_description": "discogs",
        "memory_description": "The 'Condition' filter for items requires explicit selection from a dropdown, not direct text input or assumed state.",
        "content_body": "On Discogs, when attempting to filter items by condition (e.g., 'very good'), the 'Condition' filter is not a visible text field but a dropdown menu that must be explicitly clicked and selected from. This means users cannot type directly into a field to set the condition; instead, they must locate the 'Condition' dropdown, click it to reveal options, and then select 'very good' from the list. Failure to interact with the dropdown in this way will result in the filter not being applied, leading to incorrect or incomplete search results."
      }
    },
