      "payload": {
        "scenario_description": "kayak",
        "memory_description": "The Kayak website lacks a clear and dedicated interface for specifying round-trip flight dates and airports, leading to failed interactions when attempting to input departure and return dates along with specific airports.",
        "content_body": "On the Kayak website, users attempting to look up round-trip flights encounter difficulties when specifying departure and return dates, as well as the destination airport. The website does not provide a clearly labeled and dedicated input area for entering the departure date (e.g., 6/16), return date (e.g., 6/23), and the specific airport (e.g., Narita, Japan). Instead, the date fields and airport selection may be dynamically positioned, mislabeled, or grouped with other travel-related fields, making it challenging to accurately input the required information. This lack of clarity and consistent UI design for round-trip flight searches leads to failed interactions for users attempting to book such flights."
      }
    },
