      "payload": {
        "scenario_description": "ryanair",
        "memory_description": "The Ryanair website does not support booking tickets for food and drink attractions, leading to task failure when attempting such a request.",
        "content_body": "The Ryanair website is designed exclusively for booking flights, additional flight services (such as baggage and seat selection), and related travel products. It does not include functionality for booking tickets to food and drink attractions or other non-flight-related experiences. Users attempting to book tickets for food and drink attractions on the Ryanair website will encounter missing UI elements, non-existent forms, and no interaction pathways for such reservations. This limitation is not clearly communicated on the site, leading to task failure when users assume this functionality is available."
      }
