        "scenario_description": "ryanair",
        "memory_description": "The Ryanair website requires specific date formatting for the departure date field, which was not previously documented.",
        "content_body": "On the Ryanair website, when entering a departure date in the flight search form, the input must be formatted as 'DD/MM/YYYY' (e.g., '22/04/2023' for April 22, 2023). This specific date format is not clearly indicated in the UI, and failure to follow this rule results in the system not processing the date correctly, leading to task failure."
