      "payload": {
        "scenario_description": "yellowpages",
        "memory_description": "The Yellowpages website requires explicit navigation to a 'Popular Businesses' or 'Top Rated' panel before applying location filters, which was not previously documented.",
        "content_body": "On the Yellowpages website, to successfully show a list of popular businesses in Cleveland, users must first navigate to the 'Popular Businesses' or 'Top Rated' panel (often labeled as 'Top Rated Businesses' or 'Popular in Cleveland'). From there, they should use the filtering options within that panel to specify the location as 'Cleveland' exactly as the system expects, without any additional formatting or abbreviations. This process ensures that the filtering panel is properly engaged before applying location criteria to display popular businesses."
      }
