        "memory_description": "The 'united' website allows access to the baggage fee calculator through a direct, three-step click sequence with clearly identifiable and consistently labeled UI elements.",
        "content_body": "On the 'united' website, the baggage fee calculator can be accessed by following a direct, three-step interaction involving clearly labeled and consistently positioned UI elements. The process involves clicking on three distinct elements in sequence: first, a top-level navigation or menu item (element ID 929), then a sub-menu or section link (element ID 4547), and finally a specific calculator option or button (element ID 5555). Each step involves a visible, labeled element with no hidden toggles, timing dependencies, or case-sensitivity requirements. This trajectory demonstrates that, unlike other tasks on the site, the baggage fee calculator is accessible through a straightforward, predictable interaction path without requiring users to discover or engage with non-obvious UI elements."
